+### Scope & Limitations
+
+The post addresses public framing of LLMs and one incident cluster. It does not define "understanding," measure framing effects, estimate capability trends, or test whether corporate risk underweighting is widespread. It is US/English-centric and relies on secondary reporting. No captured copy of the post is present in this project, so this pass works from the pass 1 analysis record and the project's corroborating corpus. External retrieval was prohibited for this run.
